s and the left end of the scale for the least similarly liked groups.<br/>\\n             <br><br/>\\n\\n             When you are ready, press the  <b>SPACEBAR</b> to start.</font>  </div>\", \"response\": \" \", \"trial_type\": \"html-keyboard-response\", \"trial_index\": 332, \"time_elapsed\": 345643, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-8.0-1.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S2_067\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S2_067\", \"browser_name\": \"Firefox\", \"browser_type\": \"108.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1920, \"windowHight\": 899}, {\"rt\": 3704, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_modularity_40.jpg\", \"slider_start\": 50, \"response\": 83, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"trial_type\": \"image-slider-response\", \"trial_index\": 333, \"time_elapsed\": 349851, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-8.0-2.0-0.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S2_067\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S2_067\", \"browser_name\": \"Firefox\", \"browser_type\": \"108.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1920, \"windowHight\": 899}, {\"rt\": 2055, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_modularity_79.jpg\", \"slider_start\": 50, \"response\": 93, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"trial_type\": \"image-slider-response\", \"trial_index\": 334, \"time_elapsed\": 351907, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-8.0-2.0-1.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S2_067\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S2_067\", \"browser_name\": \"Firefox\", \"browser_type\": \"108.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1920, \"windowHight\": 899}, {\"rt\": 1574, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_modularity_67.jpg\", \"slider_start\": 50, \"response\": 59, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"trial_type\": \"image-slider-response\", \"trial_index\": 335, \"time_elapsed\": 353483, \"internal_node_id\": \"0.0-8.0-2.0-2.0\", \"subject_id\": \"S2_067\", \"ID_DATE\": \"S2_067\", \"browser_name\": \"Firefox\", \"browser_type\": \"108.0\", \"windowWidth\": 1920, \"windowHight\": 899}, {\"rt\": 1782, \"stimulus\": \"../../img/grid_stimuli/grid_6_modularity_93.jpg\", \"slider_start\": 50, \"response\": 74, \"screen_id\": \"similarity\", \"tri